1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
Production incidents don't wait. Engineering teams shouldn't have to either.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Introducing the DevOps AI Command Center, built by Team DAANAV for the Flip the Switch Hackathon.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:19,200
Uniting human engineers and autonomous AI agents to resolve production emergencies with safety.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:26,500
A critical checkout service begins throwing HTTP 500 errors.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,500
On-call engineers face alert storms, sifting through distributed logs to locate root causes.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,500
Fragmented tools and manual handoffs delay remediation, risking cascading outages.

7
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Built with React 19, Express 5, and Socket.IO: the Obsidian Command Center.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Live telemetry metrics: MTTR reduced to 42s, 100% test pass rate, and microservice status.

9
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:19,500
Incident INC-2847 flagged: critical payment failure on the checkout API.

10
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:30,000
The Switch Agent Protocol connects humans and agents in a shared operational room.

11
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:42,000
No single-prompt hallucinations: 4 specialized agents execute distinct engineering roles.

12
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:54,500
Incident Manager, Log Analyzer, Code Fixer, and Testing Agent coordinate via Switch.

13
00:01:55,500 --> 00:02:05,000
Telegram War Room: Human operator triggers incident investigation for INC-2847.

14
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:16,500
Incident Manager and Log Analyzer identify blast radius and stack trace.

15
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Code Fixer posts a synthesized unified git diff directly into chat.

16
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:42,500
Testing Agent verifies patch with 100% test pass and attaches approval buttons.

17
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:49,500
Real-time bi-directional synchronization between Telegram and Web Cockpit.

18
00:02:50,500 --> 00:03:01,500
Detailed Code Review in the Command Center with Unified Diff Viewer.

19
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:13,500
Precision surgery: defensive optional chaining and fallback cart logic.

20
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:24,500
Preserves business logic without risky full-file rewrites.

21
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:34,500
Automated sandbox testing verifies the hotfix before human review.

22
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:44,500
100% test assertions pass with zero regressions in under 500ms.

23
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:54,500
28 automated tests across monorepo guarantee proof of correctness.

24
00:03:55,500 --> 00:04:05,000
Human-in-the-Loop Gate: AI cannot merge without explicit human sign-off.

25
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:14,500
Operator approves patch in Telegram; cryptographic signature recorded.

26
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:24,500
Status transitions to RESOLVED; MTTR finalized at 42 seconds.

27
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:36,500
Robust architecture: React 19, Express 5, PostgreSQL Prisma, and Switch Agent Protocol.

28
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:49,500
Transforming chaotic 3 AM outages into deterministic, human-governed business workflows.

29
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:57,500
One incident. One coordinated team. Humans and AI working together.

30
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:04,500
DevOps AI Command Center. Built by Team DAANAV for Flip the Switch Hackathon 2026.
